{"reviews":[{"id":"B0C17JPYXQ-0","r":5.0,"t":"Very helpful","x":"[[VIDEOID:1fb39035025642559409c946e8c30c82]] I am a hair braider and I use it for the braiding gel. It makes my job easier. I love it. Thank you","h":18,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B0C17JPYXQ-1","r":3.0,"t":"great for the price but...","x":"it works okay, but the magnet isn't very strong, so while doing an updo for someone with super thick hair, I dropped several because they shook loose and I had to &quot;refill&quot; the bracelet 3+ times. It is still better than having to reach for your box every time, and great for the price, but not the best quality out there.","h":9,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2017"},{"id":"B0C17JPYXQ-2","r":4.0,"t":"Four Stars","x":"I use this in my salon for updos and bridal hair styles.  it works out well.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2016"},{"id":"B0C17JPYXQ-3","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful, works perfectly, very comfortable to wear","x":"This works even better than I expected! Very strong magnet. There is a protective blue film on the metal plate. Once I removed it, the metal was shiny and unscratched. This will hold lots of straight pins. I would suspect that it would hold quite a few bobby pins, as well, but I didn't test that. The blue film could potential reduce the quantity of items that will stick to the magnet.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B0C17JPYXQ-4","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect for sewing!","x":"This band is great! Some reviews say the magnet isn't strong enough, but it is for me! It picked up over 150 quilting pins and held them tightly enough that when I moved that they didn't fall off. I can't speak for bobby pins, but for the crafter this product is great! If you drop tons of pins on the ground, it can make cleanup SO EASY!","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B0C17JPYXQ-5","r":5.0,"t":"Great find!","x":"Did not use for hair items but am using it for sewing.  Perfect for pins and needles for hand sewing and knitting.  The silicone strap fits snuggly but not too tight.  Have looked for one for a long time so was thrilled to find this one.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B0C17JPYXQ-6","r":5.0,"t":"Life saver","x":"I get Pakistani and Indian brides ready for their 4-6 wedding events. This requires hair pins, Bobby pins and safety pins galore. This has been a life saver for me. Absolutely love this. Highly recommend","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B0C17JPYXQ-7","r":5.0,"t":"Best thing since sliced bread!","x":"I do hair for a living and ALOT of wedding styles. This little thing has been an ABSOLUTE GODSEND! It\u2019s so handy, saves me time and all the other girls ask about it because they want one. I give it 100/10","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2019"},{"id":"B0C17JPYXQ-8","r":1.0,"t":"Dissatisfied","x":"It  is a completely different color than the one rhahks pictured; mine is clearly blue. The packaging was great but the magnetic piece is all scratched up.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B0C17JPYXQ-9","r":3.0,"t":"Magnet is inadequate","x":"I like the snug fit and the large magnetic area. The magnetic is inadequate and pins fall off.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B0C17JPYXQ-10","r":5.0,"t":"Magnetic","x":"Love it very convenient when I\u2019m working with hair.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B0C17JPYXQ-11","r":5.0,"t":"BEST INVENTION EVER!!","x":"I never thought I needed this until I bought it. As a hair dresser, I usually had to be reaching over to a table to be grabbing Bobby pins and hair ties during hair styles. This product makes it so much easier to do hair styles.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2018"},{"id":"B0C17JPYXQ-12","r":4.0,"t":"Ergonomic time saver","x":"No frills, does just what it says. Holds more Bobby pins at a time than I expected and is a great time saver. After wearing a few hours it does get a little uncomfortable around my wrist but still worth using regularly.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B0C17JPYXQ-13","r":5.0,"t":"Yessss....Hands free hairstyling \ud83e\udd17\ud83d\ude0d\ud83d\ude4c\ud83c\udffd","x":"Absolutely must have if your a stylist of any sort!!!!  Put your duck bill clips, And Bobbi pins On top of the magnet & cut time. You can still utilize both your hands!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B0C17JPYXQ-14","r":5.0,"t":"Very helpful","x":"I\u2019m a wedding hair stylist and this made updos much smoother and more efficient. Highly recommend","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2022"},{"id":"B0C17JPYXQ-15","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect for stylists!","x":"Big magnet makes my life a lot easier when styling.  Thank you!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B0C17JPYXQ-16","r":4.0,"t":"Slightly awkward size and uncomfortable band but strong magnet!","x":"Pretty strong magnet for sewing pins. Looks a lot nicer than most sewing pin wrist holders. Cons, the plate is a little large but not terrible, wrist band is not the most comfortable on a larger wrist. It comes with a blue film over the plate but it removes easily.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B0C17JPYXQ-17","r":5.0,"t":"Game Changer","x":"This honestly makes your life so much easier so you\u2019re not having to bend all kinds of ways to grab a bobby-pin while you have hair in your hand! 10/10 recommend. I sometimes forget I have it on while working weddings and don\u2019t realize it until I get home lol","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B0C17JPYXQ-18","r":5.0,"t":"Game-changer!","x":"I work a ton of weddings. This comes in so handy! It saves me from reaching for Bobby pins while trying to hold hair in place. It\u2019s as comfortable as possible too. I don\u2019t really notice it too when I\u2019m not actively using it. Highly recommend!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B0C17JPYXQ-19","r":5.0,"t":"Very comfortable","x":"I love this product I use it to hold my shine n jam on my hand while doing hair. It\u2019s very comfortable on my wrist when I\u2019m doing hair and it keeps my hands from getting dirty.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B0C17JPYXQ-20","r":3.0,"t":"Not the strongest","x":"I think it\u2019s cute and looks nice but magnet isn\u2019t strong enough to hold more than like 3 pins or they start falling off as you use your arms.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B0C17JPYXQ-21","r":2.0,"t":"Too big","x":"Definitely not one size fits all. It's way to big for my wrist. There is no way to adjust it tighter. The plate is a good size though.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2016"},{"id":"B0C17JPYXQ-22","r":2.0,"t":"Too big","x":"Definitely not one size fits all. It's way to big for my wrist. There is no way to adjust it tighter. The plate is a good size though.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2016"},{"id":"B0C17JPYXQ-23","r":5.0,"t":"A life saver when doing up styles or wigs","x":"This has a mighty grip but is never uncomfortable. Fit well on my small wrist and held lots of pins in place","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2022"},{"id":"B0C17JPYXQ-24","r":1.0,"t":"Does not fit on wrist","x":"Magnet holds strong but too large to fit wrist, loose fit. I have large wrist. Very disappointed in this.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2018"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Hair stylists and braiders find it a major time-saver that makes updos and styling easier and more efficient.","cites":[1,3,7,8,12,14,15]},{"text":"Many reviewers say the magnet is strong and holds a large number of pins securely.","cites":[4,5,13]},{"text":"Some reviewers find the magnet too weak, causing pins to fall off or shake loose.","cites":[2,10]},{"text":"It is also popular for sewing and crafting, holding pins and needles well.","cites":[5,6]},{"text":"A few note issues like a scratched magnetic plate, wrong color, or wrist discomfort after long wear.","cites":[9,13]}]},"qa":[]}